OL,3,GNEWSARare school organ secures funds
OL,4,Afor restoration
OL,5,
OL,6,FA school in west London has secured the
OL,7,Fmoney it needs to restore a rare pipe
OL,8,Forgan that nuns smuggled out of Paris
OL,9,Fmore than a century ago.
OL,11,FSacred Heart High School in Hammersmith
OL,12,Fraised just over #80,000 through
OL,13,Fdonations and events, and the National
OL,14,FLottery Heritage Fund has agreed to
OL,15,Fcover the rest.
OL,17,FThe instrument, built by Belgian
OL,18,Fcraftsman Hippolyte Loret, was secretly
OL,19,Fshipped to London in 1904 to stop the
OL,20,FFrench government seizing it.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
