OL,3,GNEWSARare school organ secures funds
OL,4,Afor restoration
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlex Dijkhuis, who works at the school
OL,7,Fand is involved in the project, said:
OL,8,F"I can't tell you how exciting it's
OL,9,Fbeen."
